+# Shared Canon — tolkien — ch-01 (SOURCE TRUTH, tier-neutral)
+
+*Written by chronicler on muse-accept. This is the SHARED, tier-invariant source-truth layer. It holds
+**source names only** — no tier-transformed rendering may appear here (Inv.3); those live under
+`kb/adaptations/tolkien/tier-<N>/`. Source names are taken from `work/analysis/ch-01.yaml`.*
+
+## Hard source facts (ch-01 — "The Siege at the Grey City")
+- **Sauron** (the dark lord) directs an assault on the Grey City from afar; he does not ride with the host.
+- **Denethor** (the Steward) has fallen into despair and withdraws from the defense.
+- **Théoden** (the old king) leads the mountain-riders against the host and is struck down.
+- **Éowyn** stands over the fallen king and destroys the attacking **Nazgûl** rider.
+- Many soldiers fall; the city nevertheless holds and the host withdraws eastward.
+
+*(These are the accepted durable facts for ch-01, in source framing. Per-tier renderings of these facts
+live under `kb/adaptations/tolkien/tier-<N>/`, never here.)*
